<title>USA: CoreStates to buy back shrs, raises payout.</title>
<headline>CoreStates to buy back shrs, raises payout.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CoreStates Financial Group said Wednesday that its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 22 million, or 10 percent of the company's common shares outstanding, and has raised its quarterly dividend to $0.47 a share from $0.42.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on January 1, 1997 to holders of record December 9, 1996.</p>
</text>
